        "text_yHEyiK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <strong>Lucky Penny Kitties</strong>, our mission is to rescue, rehabilitate, and advocate for cats and kittens in need by providing compassionate, foster-based care and helping them find loving forever homes. As a no-kill rescue, we believe every animal deserves a second chance, regardless of age, medical needs, or circumstance.</p><p>Driven by compassion and supported by our incredible community, we are working toward an even greater vision: establishing <strong>Bremer County's first full-service humane society</strong>. Our goal is to create a safe, welcoming place where animals receive the care they deserve and families can find the resources and support they need. We envision a future where no animal is left without hope and no family has to face difficult situations alone.</p><p>Every rescue, every adoption, every foster home, and every act of kindness brings us one step closer to making that vision a reality.</p><h2><strong>Help Us Build the Future</strong></h2><p>Building a humane society is a community effort, and we can't do it without your support.</p><p>Whether you choose to make a monetary donation, contribute land, building materials, supplies, professional services, or volunteer your time, every gift helps us move closer to creating a permanent home for animals in need throughout Bremer County.</p><p>If you would like to partner with us, donate, or learn more about how you can make a difference, we'd love to hear from you.</p><h3>Contact Us</h3><p><strong>Email</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"mailto:meow@luckypennykitties.org\" title=\"mailto:meow@luckypennykitties.org\"><strong>meow@luckypennykitties.org</strong><br/></a></li><li><a href=\"mailto:dzeneta@luckypennykitties.org\" title=\"mailto:dzeneta@luckypennykitties.org\"><strong>dzeneta@luckypennykitties.org</strong></a><br/></li></ul><p><strong>Call or Text</strong><br/><br/><strong>(319) 559-4889</strong></p><p><strong>Together, we're building more than a rescue—we're building a future where every animal has a safe place to land, every family has access to compassionate resources, and every life is valued.</strong> ❤️🐾</p>"
          }
